=head1 NAME

_WRITE_ZPD_LOGFILE_ - Write ZPD file statistics to a log file

=head1 SYNOPSIS

    _WRITE_ZPD_LOGFILE_

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This primitive obtains statistics for the files currently in the frame
and writes the information to C<log.zeropath>.  It includes the scan
direction (if uhdr C<FTS_SCANDIR_ZPD> indicates that direction-specific
processing was requested) and the shutter in the beam (if this has been
determined and made available via the uhdr C<FTS_ZPD_SHUTTER>).

